# Local agent instructions — kept out of the repository
CLAUDE.md

# Review write-ups. Working documents: what a review looked at, in what order,
# and what was left alone. Whatever they conclude that outlives the review goes
# where it is read — the fix, its test, a rule in CLAUDE.md, a measurement in
# spikes/RESULTS.md — so the file itself is not the record.
code_review*.md

